    description:
      "System design and technology decisions for new builds or platforms under strain — evaluating trade-offs before they become expensive to reverse.",
  },
  {
    title: "Delivery & Program Management",
    description:
      "Getting multi-team, multi-stakeholder programs unstuck — agile process, cross-team coordination, and predictable delivery against acceptance criteria.",
  },
  {
    title: "Technical Due Diligence",
